{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_00.27.55.04_00007768.gif?t=1745851911\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Rogue-like, Tower Defense Auto-Battler. Raise the dead, battle knights and wage war with fleets of advanced futuristic Drones as you battle across the eras in this strategic combat simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base, unlock new technology, destroy the enemy before they can level up.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_00.27.55.04_00009851.gif?t=1745851911\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolve Through Time:</strong> Start with swords and shields and advance to lasers and drones as you adapt to shifting battlefronts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Command &amp; Conquer:</strong> Strategically place defenses, upgrade your arsenal, and outmaneuver cunning foes.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Art Style:</strong> Vibrant cel-shaded visuals bring rich, evolving battlegrounds to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Balance between tactical decision-making and the chaos of combat.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your home base, Add turrets, capture emplacements to build your defenses.<br><br> Demo limitations:<br>Matches will be limited to 1 upgrade per session with an option before starting which era to begin in.<br>Demo is locked to Classic game mode<br>Stats tracking will not be saved<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_00.27.55.04_00010436.gif?t=1745851911\" /> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of adaptation and claim victory in an ever-changing battlefield. Whether you're defending crumbling ruins or harnessing futuristic power, every decision brings you closer to conquering the ages.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_09.36.51.08_00001138.gif?t=1745851911\" />  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597810?t=1745851911","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/7708ffd119489dd805117c80ab68885bff030279/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745851911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/df62b6c581ff218b1632941f7f9557b86e1ef8cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745851911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/df62b6c581ff218b1632941f7f9557b86e1ef8cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745851911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_00.27.55.04_00007768.gif?t=1745851911\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Rogue-like, Tower Defense Auto-Battler. Raise the dead, battle knights and wage war with fleets of advanced futuristic Drones as you battle across the eras in this strategic combat simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base, unlock new technology, destroy the enemy before they can level up.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_00.27.55.04_00009851.gif?t=1745851911\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolve Through Time:</strong> Start with swords and shields and advance to lasers and drones as you adapt to shifting battlefronts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Command &amp; Conquer:</strong> Strategically place defenses, upgrade your arsenal, and outmaneuver cunning foes.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Art Style:</strong> Vibrant cel-shaded visuals bring rich, evolving battlegrounds to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Balance between tactical decision-making and the chaos of combat.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your home base, Add turrets, capture emplacements to build your defenses.<br><br> Demo limitations:<br>Matches will be limited to 1 upgrade per session with an option before starting which era to begin in.<br>Demo is locked to Classic game mode<br>Stats tracking will not be saved<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_00.27.55.04_00010436.gif?t=1745851911\" /> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of adaptation and claim victory in an ever-changing battlefield. Whether you're defending crumbling ruins or harnessing futuristic power, every decision brings you closer to conquering the ages.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/extras/Warbound_2025.04.07_-_09.36.51.08_00001138.gif?t=1745851911\" />  </p>","developers":["Construct Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3078030","name":"Warbound"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597810/4a9af97c3d5a8078b0919ebc662120e48ff1f50d/header.j